      "Language": "ita",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "On the basis of recent literature, earlier contributions made by this department and personal experience, the A. report their findings and comments on mastalgia, a frequent symptom in modern female pathologies. They affirm that good results have been achieved through information, health education and treatment with non-steroid anti-inflammatory drugs, without resorting to hormone therapy except in carefully selected cases."},
